    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/b691e6a881f54df3909e080673162a04.avif?t=1732083604\" width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based battle game in a 2D cartoon style set against the backdrop of future space warfare. Players take on the role of a spaceship captain, continuously improving their spaceship's construction and defending against invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/01694688401abf31e725ad0be5b755d3.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to protect your starship's core from being destroyed by enemies and destroy the enemy's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/e0ee468bbbb8f102157b7f439d318385.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, purchase and craft more advanced equipment to enhance the starship's combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/1057b71c0426fc2da0ba9cc975852b4b.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right equipment, formulate a strategy, place them in the optimal positions, and prepare for the upcoming battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/0d1147994f27f86aa837e22e39aaf654.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out opponents of equal strength and engage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/b691e6a881f54df3909e080673162a04.avif?t=1732083604\" width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based battle game in a 2D cartoon style set against the backdrop of future space warfare. Players take on the role of a spaceship captain, continuously improving their spaceship's construction and defending against invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/01694688401abf31e725ad0be5b755d3.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to protect your starship's core from being destroyed by enemies and destroy the enemy's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/d20c4a657ff7d3c8f529b299de3aaa22.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/e0ee468bbbb8f102157b7f439d318385.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, purchase and craft more advanced equipment to enhance the starship's combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/a634a9cbd4550e1e74fed275297e0f36.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/1057b71c0426fc2da0ba9cc975852b4b.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right equipment, formulate a strategy, place them in the optimal positions, and prepare for the upcoming battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/500a6ee1b32c3313599423be712f8a5c.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/0d1147994f27f86aa837e22e39aaf654.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out opponents of equal strength and engage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.poster.avif?t=1732083604\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.webm?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042640/extras/9cb454b589c6c99a7d92098ded1fd2be.mp4?t=1732083604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
